<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/render.sidebar.lays`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "lay the wiki's sidebar out, fixed-fluid or fluid-fixed"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///render.sidebar.lays"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/render.sidebar.lays"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/render.sidebar.lays"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! render.sidebar.lays ~ the wiki lays its sidebar out through the engine's own keyboard action

The act runs TiddlyWiki's own sidebar-layout action (`$:/core/ui/KeyboardShortcuts/change-sidebar-layout`, read from its unoverridden floor shadow) in the wiki `recipe` names, on an isolated view whose one writable target names the layout record (`$:/themes/tiddlywiki/vanilla/options/sidebarlayout`), and lands that change through the ordinary gated put with its receipt. `expected` names the layout the caller last read and `resulting` the layout it asks; a stale `expected` answers `conflict` and writes nothing. The call carries values alone, never action text.

Every surface reaches it by its address: `lares lar:///render.sidebar.lays expected=fixed-fluid resulting=fluid-fixed`, `act(address="lar:///render.sidebar.lays", args={…})` on the seat, and the port's `call` ask on the glass. The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ widen-the-story

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`widen-the-story` params=`recipe/default expected/fixed-fluid resulting/fluid-fixed ~ the story river takes the fluid side; a stale expected answers conflict`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ container · expected · resulting

```memetic-wikitext
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/container`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`expected` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the layout last read: fixed-fluid or fluid-fixed`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`resulting` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ the layout asked: the other of the two`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the wiki's working layer takes the change through the gated put; the face's write cap decides`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ wiki-action-parameter · wiki-action-origin · wiki-action-scope

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-action-parameter` params=`cure/[[render.sidebar.lays expected/fixed-fluid resulting/fluid-fixed]] ~ expected and resulting each name a layout, and the two differ`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-action-origin` params=`~ an overriding tiddler stands over the action's floor shadow; nothing ran`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`wiki-action-scope` params=`~ the action reached past its one target; nothing landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ put · conflict

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`put` params=`fields/[[title expected resulting decision receipt change]] ~ the layout landed through the put, its receipt beside it`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`conflict` params=`fields/[[title expected observed]] ~ the layout read differs from expected; nothing landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///render.sidebar.lays

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`spells/[[act lar:///render.sidebar.lays]] omits/face ~ the seat; the vessel runs it`>>
```

